% expect-output: 27.336
% expect-output: 0.0
% divergence: resident-inventory
% Scenario: Helvetica widths. stringwidth sums the resident metrics of
% the string's glyphs through the scaled font matrix. The sum is rounded
% to a thousandth for printing, since the scaled matrix is a single-
% precision product.
% Expect: 27.336 and 0.0.
/r { 1000 mul round 1000 div } def
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
(Hello) stringwidth r exch r = =
